+1. Stable network IDs for actors, projectiles, pickups, movers, and scripted objects.
+2. Host-owned enemy targeting, health, death, and spawn state.
+3. Reliable pickup/inventory/key transactions.
+4. INF/mover state snapshots and periodic world checksums.
+5. Coordinated mission start, cutscenes, completion, and level transition.
+6. Per-player health, death, revive, HUD, and save serialization.
+7. Two-instance local split-screen launcher, followed later by native dual-camera split-screen.
